<title>UK: West Bromwich B/S buys 57 mln stg UK mortgage book.</title>
<headline>West Bromwich B/S buys 57 mln stg UK mortgage book.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The West Bromwich Building Society, Britain's 18th largest, said it had bought a 57 million stg residential mortgage portfolio from Mortgage Trust, the UK lending unit of Ireland's largest society First National.</p>
<p>As part of the deal, Mortgage Trust will continue to administer the mortgages.</p>
<p>The portfolio of nearly 1,000 fixed rate loans takes the West Bromwich's assets to some 1.8 billion stg. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
